  schools:
  - schoolValue: 0
    schoolName: Sacred Gate
    mapDirection: 'Direction: Located in West'
    description: Sacred Gate Campus is the first educational institution built by the Sacred Financial Group. Boasting Eastern infrastructures and designs, this campus is the center of History, Social Science, Language and Literature. It also boasts a huge library dedicated to Shamanism and researches related to martial arts.
    schoolButton: {fileID: 0}
  - schoolValue: 1
    schoolName: Mystic Peak
    mapDirection: 'Direction: Located in North'
    description: Mystic Peak is the second campus created by the Sacred Financial Group located at the Northern area of RAN world. Its aura reflects the grandeur of Western civilizations in their prime. The stained glass windows, scenic plazas, and rich flora and fauna reflect the academy's dedication to the Arts and Natural Science.
    schoolButton: {fileID: 0}
  - schoolValue: 2
    schoolName: Phoenix
    mapDirection: 'Direction: Located in South'
    description: Phoenix campus is the third educational institution of the Sacred Financial Group. Its campus is located in the Southern area of the RAN world. Renowned for its advanced engineering curriculum, this campus fascinates the members of high society. Phoenix offers the engineers and scientists of tomorrow access to the most expansive and advanced technology, free to test out their theories and experiments.
    schoolButton: {fileID: 0}
  selectedButtonColor: {r: 1, g: 0.83, b: 0.35, a: 1}
  cardSlotIndex: -1
